              <div>D-Wave Quantum&#8217;s future capital requirements and sources and uses of cash;</div>
            </td>
          </tr>

      </table>
      <table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" id="zda0ec2cbfc3b42399713c18354f85cae" class="DSPFListTable" style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: #000000;">

