            <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify;">
              <div>statements regarding the reseller agreement with Davidson Technologies, Inc. (&#8220;<font style="font-style: italic;">Davidson</font>&#8221;), and Davidson&#8217;s and D-Wave&#8217;s collaboration on an initiative to support classified quantum-hybrid
                applications;</div>
            </td>
          </tr>

      </table>
      <table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" id="zf0e52798359846df869f2395c1c0c815" class="DSPFListTable" style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: #000000;">

