            </td>
            <td style="width: 18pt; vertical-align: top;">&#8226;</td>
            <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify;">
              <div>D-Wave Quantum&#8217;s ability to recognize the anticipated benefits of the Transaction, which may be affected by, among other things, competition and the ability of D-Wave Quantum to grow and achieve and maintain profitability following the
                Transaction;</div>
            </td>
          </tr>

      </table>
      <table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" id="z4aa2bb3d19d54fe1b275036abdd35299" class="DSPFListTable" style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: #000000;">

