      <div>&#160;</div>
      <div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt;">Research and development expenses increased by <font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">$6.7 million</font>, or <font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">26%</font>, to <font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">$32.1







          million</font> for the <font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">year ended December 31, 2022</font>&#160;<font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">compared</font> to <font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">$25.4 million</font> for the <font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">year ended December 31, 2021</font>.&#160; The increase in research and development expenses was primarily driven by:</div>
      <div>&#160;</div>
      <table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" id="z341cce21e81945bfa0f78d22edcd36e9" class="DSPFListTable" style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: #000000;">

