            <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top;">
              <div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">An increase of $4.5 million in third party professional services from legal and accounting consultants, including $0.2 million in transfer agent fees;</div>
            </td>
          </tr>

      </table>
      <div>&#160;</div>
      <table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" id="zfe4452e5bfce43eeb645a5a813415be7" class="DSPFListTable" style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: #000000;">

