              <div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">An increase of $1.5 million in stock-based compensation due to the issuance of stock option and restricted stock unit awards;</div>
            </td>
          </tr>

      </table>
      <div>&#160;</div>
      <table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" id="zbc8607b2972d45f8b5f847c567d297ee" class="DSPFListTable" style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: #000000;">

