      <div>&#160;</div>
      <div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt; color: #000000;">We expect our general and administrative expenses to increase in absolute dollars for the foreseeable future as a result of operating as a public company, including expenses related
        to compliance with the rules and regulations of the SEC and the NYSE, additional insurance costs, higher audit fees, investor relations activities, and other administrative and professional services.</div>
