      <div>&#160;</div>
      <div style="text-align: justify; margin-left: 18pt;"><font style="color: #000000;">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</font>We expect our sales and marketing expenses to increase in absolute dollars as we hire additional sales and marketing personnel, expand our sales
        professional support, and market our QCaaS cloud service offerings to further penetrate the United States and international markets.</div>
