      <div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt; color: #000000;">Non-cash interest income on SIF increased by $5.7 million for the year ended December 31, 2022 as compared to nil for the year ended December 31, 2021. The amount was related to a
        decrease in the average principal balance of our SIF loan as of December 31, 2022. See Note 2 included in the notes to our audited consolidated financial statements as of and for the year ended December 31, 2022 included elsewhere in this Form 10-K
        for details regarding the government assistance programs.</div>
