      <div>&#160;</div>
      <div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt;">Government assistance decreased by <font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">$4.9 million</font>, or <font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">40%</font>, to <font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">$7.2 million</font>
        for the year ended <font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">December 31, 2021</font> as compared to <font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">$12.0 million</font> for the year ended <font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">December 31, 2020</font>. The decrease
        was mainly driven by the deemed interest benefit associated with the SIF Loan secured during the year ended <font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">December 31, 2020</font>.</div>
