      <div>&#160;</div>
      <div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt;">During the year ended <font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">December 31, 2021</font>, we recorded <font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">$1.2 million</font> in gain on investment in marketable
        securities based on the valuation of<font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"> one of the Company&#8217;s investments. </font>We did not record any gain on investment in marketable securities during the year ended <font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">December
          31, 2020</font>.</div>
      <div><br>
      </div>
      <div style="font-style: italic;">Other income, <font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">net</font></div>
