      </div>
      <div style="color: #000000; font-style: italic;">Common stock warrants</div>
      <div>&#160;</div>
      <div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt; color: #000000;">On April 14, 2022,&#160; 617,972 common stock warrants of D-Wave Systems with an exercise price of $1.75 expired.&#160; As of December 31, 2022, there are no common stock warrants
        outstanding.</div>
      <div>&#160;</div>
      <div style="text-align: justify; color: #000000; font-style: italic;">Preferred stock warrants</div>
      <div>&#160;</div>
      <div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt; color: #000000;">The Company did not record any movements during the year ended December 31, 2022.</div>
      <div>&#160;</div>
      <div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt; color: #000000;">As of December 31, 2022, the following preferred stock warrants of D-Wave Systems were outstanding and exercisable:</div>
