      <div>&#160;</div>
      <div style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 36pt; color: #000000;">As a result of the Merger (see Note 33), the Company has retroactively adjusted the weighted average shares outstanding prior to August 5, 2022 to give effect to the Conversion
        Ratio used to determine the number of Common Shares into which they were converted.</div>
